OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fand overnight will be mostly cloudy
OL,7,Fwith the odd shower in the west. The
OL,8,Feast will be dry with clearer spells.
OL,9,FNot quite as cold as the previous
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,13,Fbut with some bright intervals
OL,14,Fbreaking through, particularly in the
OL,15,Feast. Showers or outbreaks of rain in
OL,16,Fthe evening. Windy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
